{"id":"4f6c74e9e6793301","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation.md","title":"Savitch's Theorem","display":"thm-savitch — Savitch's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation","aliases":["73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation","73-thm-savitch"],"display":"thm-savitch — Savitch's Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","[[73-df-binary-pspace]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation</span><span>73-thm-savitch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-savitch — Savitch's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"79e0c730e7cd49f6\" href=\"?note=79e0c730e7cd49f6\" title=\"73-df-binary-pspace\">73-df-binary-pspace</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NSPACE}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\)</span> (nondeterministic space classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{DSPACE}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\)</span> (deterministic space classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}\">\\(\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}\\)</span> (full space constructibility)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s(n)\\bigr)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s(n)\\bigr)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}=\\mathsf{PSPACE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}=\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recursive midpoint reachability decides whether one configuration reaches another within the finite configuration bound. Each recursion level stores two <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span> configurations and the depth is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span>, giving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n)^2)\">\\(O(s(n)^2)\\)</span> deterministic space.</li>\n<li>Applying the inclusion to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+1)^k\">\\((n+1)^k\\)</span> bounds and using the trivial deterministic-to-nondeterministic inclusion yields the class equality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","status":"resolved","id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"79e0c730e7cd49f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NSPACE}$ and $\\mathsf{NPSPACE}$ (nondeterministic space classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s(n)\\bigr)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}savitch}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}=\\mathsf{PSPACE}","display":true},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n)^2)","display":false},{"tex":"(n+1)^k","display":false}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"135dd1fbff4fec6c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1a769cdc24b3e236","5487b1bca12f6c5f","cadee7248274622b","79e0c730e7cd49f6"]}